## Feature summary (web, SideFX reference)

- Source: https://www.sidefx.com/docs/houdini/nodes/cop/sopimport.html
- Summary (EN): SOP Import brings SOP geometry into Copernicus as a geometry wire. The geometry comes either from an external SOP network selected by path or from the node's own internal contents.
- Résumé (FR) : SOP Import fait entrer une géométrie SOP dans Copernicus comme un fil de géométrie, soit depuis un réseau SOP externe, soit depuis son propre contenu.

- Inputs meaning: ["None documented: the node takes geometry from an external SOP path or from its own contents"]

- Key parameters: ["Use External SOP: on takes geometry from the SOP at SOP Path, off uses the node's own geometry", "SOP Path: path of the SOP to use as source, available when Use External SOP is on", "Output: single geometry output carrying the SOP geometry"]

- Caveats: ["No space transform is applied to the geometry", "To bake a transform, place an Object Merge SOP inside the node"]

